Split this chapter into exactly {{ n }} scenes of about {{ words }} words each. For every scene:
- pov_character_id and participants: ids from the cast list;
- want / obstacle / change: what the POV character wants, what stands in the way, what is different at the end;
- story_value and value_charge: the value at stake and how it flips, e.g. "+ -> -" (it must change);
- temporal_mode: "linear" unless the scene is a flashback, flashforward, dream or unreliable account.
  A flashback or flashforward must set happens_after to the earlier scene it follows in story time; otherwise "none".
